# Testing

Use xUnit. Cover one acceptance criterion per test. Include the criterion id `AC-00N` in the test name.

Reach the LLM only through a fake of `IVisionInterpreter`. Do not call a real model. Tests must not need a database or a chosen vendor.

```csharp
[Fact(DisplayName = "AC-001 returns id, summary, objects, and extracted text")]
public async Task Returns_interpretation_for_a_valid_image()
{
    IVisionInterpreter vision = new FakeVisionInterpreter();
}
```
